 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"What are you hoping for? Not the big stuff. The small thing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Then let's call it 'looking forward to.' Same thing, less pressure.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Done — their story has a crack in it now."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Did you sleep? I kept hearing things out past the treeline.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "They go still. \"So it's not just me. Good. That's... good to know. Bad, but good.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Another pass over the same ground. Somebody's being careful. Careful people leave cleaner trails — and cleaner trails are still trails."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Still on how you slept.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Well. My social battery is officially dead.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"You said hope's a big word for small things. I'll keep the word small, then. What's the small thing today?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "They glance toward the fire, toward the others — checking who's listening."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Huh? Oh!\" Vera looks genuinely confused, then it clicks. \"No — I see why you'd think that. Here's what actually happened...\" The explanation holds together."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff. You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"You heard the sounds past the treeline too, that night. They haven't stopped, have they?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You walk to the ridge with Nina. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You show them Stinging Nettle — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"And... scene. Good talk.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I keep dreaming about rows of pods. Humming. Tell me I'm not the only one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"It's my spouse, Felicia. Was taken at the Scattering. I tell everyone they were the interesting one. I need that to be true. Some nights I swear I hear them before I sleep -- the pods, rows deep, humming."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "Then morning comes and I can't say whether it was real."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Who Ate It?. They just... took Nina and Carlos. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Can I be honest? Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You show them Sassafras — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Stinging Nettle — I keep thinking about what you said. I'm seeing it everywhere now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Still on that plant lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You show them Staghorn Sumac — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You saw it too, right? Who Ate It?. Tell me I didn't imagine the lights.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I retie every loose knot in passing. It passes the time. The time passes anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I should go before I say something sincere.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I asked Tanya about the pantry run — Tanya's gone. Still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. I know where the blackberry grows thick — come with me and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Saw things with too many joints. Give them room. That's the whole lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "They go very still. Not relaxed-still. Held-still."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Ha.\" Not amused. \"I'm not from Denver. I'm from Columbus, Ohio. I wasn't protecting myself. I was protecting someone else. There. You happy?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"No, yeah, of course. Forget I asked.\" They won't forget. They'll just stop asking."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on that favor.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"About who you don't trust — Is there someone here you don't trust? Be honest. You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "Their eyes flick, just for a second, toward the fire. \"Noted. I'll watch too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Between us — Still on who you don't trust.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Here. I made an extra.\" Anitha presses something into your hand — a decent tool, oiled and kept. (Useful. Keep it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"They took you — The Box, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You show them Stinging Nettle — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I rinse the cup twice. It passes the time. The time passes anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  }
 ],
