    "bearerSample": [
     "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Skylar Caruso is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
     "🕯️ Skylar Caruso is dead — the arena. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
     "\"Skylar's gone.\" Nina looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Skylar.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "📖 LEARNED: Animal Behavior (Level 1). Most animals flee. Give them an escape route and they take it. Cornered animals fight.",
     "Birds scatter in a sudden hush — something is moving out there. You give it a wide berth.",
